  "final_answer": "I have successfully found a beginner's acrylic paint set on Amazon that meets all the criteria. Here is my answer:\n\n## 🖌️ Recommended Product\n\n**Artkey Acrylic Paint Set, 24 Colors 2 oz/59 ml Acrylic Paint Kit for Professional Artists & Beginners – Craft & Art Supplies for Canvas, Wood, Fabric, Rock, Leather, Ceramic, Glass, Easter Egg**\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Title** | Artkey Acrylic Paint Set, 24 Colors 2 oz/59 ml Acrylic Paint Kit for Professional Artists & Beginners |\n| **Price** | **$17.99** ($0.37 / fluid ounce) |\n| **Color Count** | 24 Colors |\n| **Suitable For** | Canvas (Surface Recommendation: Canvas, Wood, Rock, Clay, Fabric, Ceramics) |\n| **URL** | https://www.amazon.com/Artkey-Acrylic-Paint-Set-Professional/dp/B09TWQD5ZL/ |\n\n### Why it matches all your requirements:\n- ✅ **Beginner-friendly**: Explicitly marketed for \"Professional Artists & **Beginners**\"\n- ✅ **At least 24 colors**: Includes 24 vibrant colors in 2 oz/59 ml bottles\n- ✅ **Suitable for canvas painting**: Listed as craft supplies for canvas (also works on wood, fabric, rock, leather, ceramic, glass)\n- ✅ **Priced under $40**: $17.99 — well below the $40 limit\n\n### Additional context:\n- **Rating**: 4.6 out of 5 stars (2,797 reviews)\n- **Popularity badge**: Amazon's \"**Overall Pick**\" with 3K+ bought in past month\n- **Seller**: Artkey Artistic\n\nThis is an excellent choice for beginners, offering high-quality acrylic paint at a very affordable price point with enough variety (24 colors) to explore creative projects on canvas.",
